{
  "_comment": [
    "An adiona-SHAPED domain fixture for the business catalog round-trip.",
    "Structural, not schematic: one polymorphic entity with a type discriminator, an EAV",
    "attrs map, a self-referencing taxonomy, localized content split out by language, and",
    "M:N category membership. The adiona TABLES were never the target.",
    "",
    "The hierarchy is deliberately 3 deep (root -> beach -> beach_family) so the ancestor",
    "closure has something to close over: an item on the leaf must be findable by a query",
    "for the ROOT, which a single array-contains can only do if the closure was",
    "materialised at write time."
  ],
